# Supernotes

- Product: minimalist notes, daily notes, tasks, calendar, meeting transcription, and an AI agent surface.
- Repo is greenfield — ship the smallest change that satisfies the request; do not scaffold an entire app unprompted.
- Match existing code style and structure once they exist; until then, keep new code boring and explicit.
- No secrets in the tree. Use environment secrets / local env files that stay gitignored.
- Prefer one focused PR-sized concern over drive-by refactors.
